<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 5,200 MT were the result of increases for Nicaragua (2,700 MT), Colombia (2,000 MT), Jamaica (1,500 MT), and Canada (100 MT) being partially offset by reductions of 1,200 MT for Haiti.</p>
<p>Exports of 6,300 MT were mainly to Haiti (3,000 MT) and Nicaragua (2,500 MT).</p>
</text>
